# Branching (hard rule)

See [`docs/BRANCHING.md`](docs/BRANCHING.md).

| Branch | Use |
|--------|-----|
| **`test`** | All development. Default. Stay here. |
| **`main`** | TestFlight / App Store **candidate**. Archive + upload here. No feature commits. |
| **`release`** | Production ledger only. |

## Never

- Commit or feature-work on **`main`** or **`release`**.
- Touch **`release`** or open/merge **`main` → `release`** unless the human **explicitly** says the build is **live in production** (Distribute / customers). TestFlight or “approved” alone is not enough.
- Open a PR from **`test` → `release`**.
- Leave the working branch on **`main`** after a promote — switch back to **`test`**.

## Film debug picker

**DEBUG + `test` only.** Never visible on `main` / TestFlight / App Store / `release`. Keep `#if DEBUG` + `BuildChannel.isTestBranch`. See [`.cursor/rules/film-debug-picker.mdc`](film-debug-picker.mdc).

## Gallery

Never wipe `Documents/polaroids`. See [`.cursor/rules/gallery-persistence.mdc`](gallery-persistence.mdc).
